					<![CDATA[
						 <p>Thing is, none of those are Js, they're all mainlisters and need to have some kind of seriousness. Js don't need to be serious at all, just well written enough to be clever or funny. This not being funny is a valid reason to down vote, but serious clinical tone is not a necessity here, but it does help to contrast with the wackiness.</p> 
